{"scene_id": "pt_hedda_34", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_hedda_34.fountain", "heading": "INT. HEDDA - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. HEDDA - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "It is useless, Madam.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "No one will be admitted.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, at least tell me what has happened to him?", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "What is it?", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "You don't mean to say that he has himself-- Eh?", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I am sure he has.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "[Keeping his eyes fixed upon her.] Unfortunately you have guessed quite correctly, Mrs. Tesman.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, how horrible!", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Himself, then!", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Fancy that!", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Shot himself!", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Rightly guessed again, Mrs. Tesman.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "[With an effort at self-control.] When did it happen, Mr. Brack?", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "This afternoon--between three and four.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "But, good Lord, where did he do it?", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Eh?", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "[With some hesitation.] Where?", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Well--I suppose at his lodgings.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "No, that cannot be; for I was there between six and seven.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Well then, somewhere else.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't know exactly.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "I only know that he was found--.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "He had shot himself--in the breast.", "para": 14, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, how terrible!", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "That he should die like that!", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "[To BRACK.] Was it in the breast?", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes--as I told you.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Not in the temple?", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "In the breast, Mrs. Tesman.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, well--the breast is a good place, too.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "How do you mean, Mrs. Tesman?", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "[Evasively.] Oh, nothing--nothing.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "And the wound is dangerous, you say--eh?", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Absolutely mortal.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "The end has probably come by this time.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, yes, I feel it.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "The end!", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "The end!", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, Hedda--!", "para": 25, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "But tell me, how have you learnt all this?", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "[Curtly.] Through one of the police.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "A man I had some business with.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "[In a clear voice.] At last a deed worth doing!", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "[Terrified.] Good heavens, Hedda! what are you saying?", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "I say there is beauty in this.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "H'm, Mrs. Tesman--", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, Hedda, how can you talk of beauty in such an act!", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Eilert Lovborg has himself made up his account with life.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "He has had the courage to do--the one right thing.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "No, you must never think that was how it happened!", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "It must have been in delirium that he did it.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "In despair!", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "That he did not.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "I am certain of that.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, yes!", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "In delirium!", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Just as when he tore up our manuscript.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "[Starting.] The manuscript?", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Has he torn that up?", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, last night.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "[Whispers softly.] Oh, Hedda, we shall never get over this.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "H'm, very extraordinary.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "[Moving about the room.] To think of Eilert going out of the world in this way!", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "And not leaving behind him the book that would have immortalised his name--", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, if only it could be put together again!", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, if it only could!", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't know what I would not give--", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}